**Read:** [Improving Steam System Performance — U.S. DOE sourcebook](../sources/Steam-System-Performance-DOE.lingua#r_0T4Q6THGGEMSNGMGJHF42BFF6X), the entire generation, distribution, end-use, recovery and maintenance sourcebook; [Common Waste Water and Waste Gas Treatment/Management Systems in the Chemical Sector, BREF CWW](../sources/Chemical-Sector-Water-and-Waste-BREF.lingua#r_3DD06XBCANC091G38HBZ4BX7Y9), the complete relevant water inventory, saving and treatment chapters; [Production of Chlor-alkali, BREF CAK](../sources/Chlor-Alkali-Production-BREF.lingua#r_69QNQ29VT4NA2MXHTVWDNP8T2W), the full utility and product-system account; [Biochemical conversion of corn stover to ethanol — Humbird and colleagues](../sources/Biochemical-Ethanol-Design-Humbird.lingua#r_123G817BYJFAVYGA0ZVK3J5FJH), the entire integrated utility and wastewater design sections.

Chemical manufacture depends on water of appropriate quality, steam/heat, electricity, cooling, compressed gases, vacuum and other controlled environments. A utility's temperature, pressure, purity, availability and return condition matter alongside its gross quantity. The same nominal energy or water amount may not perform the same process duty.

Trace generation, distribution, end use, recovery and losses on compatible boundaries. A plant can transfer an apparent improvement from one utility to another or from inside to outside its reported boundary. Shared services couple several units, so a local change may alter another process's operating state or capacity.

Include purification, storage/buffering, measurement, maintenance and changed-load conditions. A good steady design point cannot establish that a process continues to meet product requirements during variable feed, utility interruption or equipment service. The actual continuity and restoration work belongs to the system account.

**Work:** reconstruct a full utility inventory for one complete chemical route, independently checking material, enthalpy and electrical bases. Compare a documented heat/water/gas integration alternative at the same accepted output and operating interval. Explain which measurement or service-history evidence establishes the claimed improvement and which supporting power/water/gas studies need deeper specialist work.

**Continue:** [Trace continued chemical production to skilled work, maintenance and repair evidence](Skilled-work-maintenance-repair-and-restored-chemical-production.lingua#r_0XD38YDA9FKJ5CY7YE630MVZ1D).

**Return:** [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618).

